king it possible to face and even conquer a massive enemy army. With this feature, you can strategize and protect yourself even in the darkest hours of the night.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/29bace3ca48578932a8613b1925850a3.poster.avif?t=1744344595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/29bace3ca48578932a8613b1925850a3.webm?t=1744344595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/29bace3ca48578932a8613b1925850a3.mp4?t=1744344595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with pony  Kill them all</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This game is far from lonely! You can count on the help of magical ponies and stallions to help battle and smash your opponents. Don't forget about the beloved WULI KUN horse, who is also available to ride and assist you in your battles. With so much support and company, you never have to venture into battle alone!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/0a633239c4f1510fcde4347a68d0b69a.poster.avif?t=1744344595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/0a633239c4f1510fcde4347a68d0b69a.webm?t=1744344595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2236590/extras/0a633239c4f1510fcde4347a68d0b69a.mp4?t=1744344595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
